The citation author list, in order, all at HES-SO Valais-Wallis. CITATION.cff
carries the same names in the same order, with the affiliation on each entry,
and is what GitHub reads; this file is the human-readable copy, and
`pyproject.toml`'s `authors` field is the packaging one. All three are the same
claim written three times, so they change together.

    1. Elia Pacioni              https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1557-4870
    2. Davide Calvaresi          https://orcid.org/0000-0001-9816-7439
    3. Andrei Catalin Coman      https://orcid.org/0009-0000-3646-2352
    4. Ismael Jaggi              https://orcid.org/0009-0005-0092-5446
    5. Valerio Crocetti          https://orcid.org/0009-0002-3760-6041
    6. Gaetano Manzo             https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1682-6865
    7. Michael Ignaz Schumacher  https://orcid.org/0000-0002-5123-5075

Who committed what is a separate question, and the git history answers it
directly: `git shortlog -sne --all`.
